WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:04.234
[ Knock on door ]
-Yo!

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:06.300
-Hey, Matthew.
-Hey, Jimmy.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.968
Merry Christmas, man.
Happy holidays.

00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:10.133
-Happy holidays. Any big plans?
-Oh, yes.

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:13.100
I'm going home to spend some
quality time with my family.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.200
-Yeah, same.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.667
I can't believe
it's been two years

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:16.901
since we got to celebrate
Christmas together.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:18.601
-Right? I know, I can't wait to
see everyone.

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:20.434
-I know.
I'll tell you one thing though.

00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:22.701
This year's going to be
a lot different than last one.

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.200
-It sure will, Jimmy.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.467
♪ This Christmas
will be different ♪

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:33.501
♪ Than Christmas
from last year ♪

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:37.400
-♪ We're trading
in the FaceTimes ♪

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.400
♪ For some in-person cheer ♪

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.367
♪ I can't wait to see them ♪

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:49.334
♪ The sights and sounds ♪

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:54.968
-♪ This Christmas, we're flying
back to our hometown ♪

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:56.067
-Excuse me.
-Hey!

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:57.200
-Sorry.
-Out of the way.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.367
-Excuse me, hey!
-Hey!

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.300
Excuse me. Let's go!

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.834
♪ There's always
that one neighbor ♪

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:04.167
♪ Who goes way too hard
with his lights ♪

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:06.167
-Hey, Matthew.
-Hey.

